<title>BAHRAIN: SABIC says work on $2.5bln plant seen Q3.</title>
<headline>SABIC says work on $2.5bln plant seen Q3.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia's industrial giant Saudi Basic Industries Corp (SABIC) said on Wednesday work on a $2.5 billion petrochemical plant jointly owned with Mobil Corp would start in the third quarter.</p>
<p>&quot;Construction is expected to begin in the third quarter of 1997 and start-up is scheduled for early 2000,&quot; a SABIC statement said.</p>
</text>
